ation. The liquidation of GIPCO has no material impact on either the business operations of the Co. or the financial position of the C 1 The above Standalone UFR have been reviewed &amp; recommended by the Audit Com &amp; taken on record &amp; approved by the Board of Directors in their respective meetings held on 11-02-2019.  2. Limited Review of the UFR for the quarter &amp; nine months ended on 31-12-2018 has been carried out by the Statutory Auditors. 3. Co. had investment in equity shares of Bhavnagar Energy Co.Ltd. (BECL) a Co. controlled by GoG. BECL has been merged with Gujarat State Electricity Corporation ltd. (GSECL), a wholly owned subsidiary of GUVNL, vide GoG Notification dated 27-08-2018, published in GoG Gazette under Gujarat Electricity Industry (Reorganization &amp; Regulation), Act, 2003, notified the Scheme called Gujarat Electricity Reform (Transfer of General Undertakings) Scheme, 2018. BECL is merged with GSECL w.e.f 01-04-2018. As per this Notification, shareholders of BECL, including our Co. are entitled to receive only one equity share of GSECL as consideration &amp; in extinguishment of their rights as shareholder of BECL. It may be noted that the transfer of the undertakings under the notified scheme is provisional for a period of twelve months from the date of the transfer i.e. up to 31-03-2019 &amp; the GoG has the power to alter the terms &amp; conditions till that time. As a consequence of the aforesaid Notification, the Co's shareholding in BECL is extinguished &amp; hence its investment of Rs. 21808 lakhs as on the date of notification is recognized as a loss in the value of investment &amp; reflected as an exceptional item in the preceding quarter ended 30-09-2018. 4. The co. in at its BM held on 21-12-2017 had approved the Voluntary liquidation of it's wholly owned subsidiary, GIPCl Projects &amp; Consultancy Co. Ltd. (GIPCO) under the Insolvency &amp; Bankruptcy code, 2016. Pursuant to the same, a liquidator has been appointed by